%%{init: {"look": "classic", "fontSize": 19}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Alice<br/>Cooper
  participant B as Bob
  actor C as Carol
  A->>B: Hello Bob, how are you?
  B-->>A: Great, thanks
  Note over A,B: A note over both
  Note right of C: Right note<br/>two rows
  loop Every minute
    B->>C: ping
  end
  alt ok
    C->>A: fine
  else bad
    C-->>A: not fine
  end
